    CLUES: {
      bleach: ['The pale ones', 'The Garden is bleaching from its down-current edge. Whatever it is, it drifts in along the bottom from the direction of the wells.'],
      tags: ['Two green tags', () => `Under light, the manifold tags for ${pair(R.k, R.i1)} glow with leak-test dye. Somebody topside already went looking. ${WN[R.i2]} was never tested.`],
      lines: ['Two live lines', () => `In the vent field, the flowlines from ${pair(R.k, R.i2)} throb with pressure. ${WN[R.i1]} is cold and dead.`],
      water: ['Bitter water', 'The water trapped in the manifold cage is chalky and bitter: barite, drilling mud. Not brine, not seep gas. Mud comes out of wells.'],
      vesper: ['What Vesper saw', 'Nine nights ago the ROV spent a long time at one well, poking at its hatch. The next night it came back and moved the beacons so its route bends away.'],
      beacon: ['Transect 9, Rev. C', 'The inspection ROV flies beacon to beacon. The route has been revised twice, and the old labels peeled off.']
    },
    ITEMS: {},
    DISC: {
      whale: ['The whale fall', 'A grey whale, or the architecture of one. She came down eleven years ago and has been feeding the neighbourhood ever since. The ribs stand like the nave of a church with a very relaxed dress code.', 'South-east, past the last leg.', { angler: "I'd like to go like that. Slowly, and with everyone talking about me for a decade.", isopod: "2019. Good year.", dumbo: "She's STILL giving! That's so generous! I'm going to cry and you can't see it because we're underwater!" }],
      pod: ['Project Evergreen: Blue', 'A white steel capsule the size of a shipping container, half sunk in silt. The logo says VERDANT SYSTEMS. Below it: ‘PROJECT EVERGREEN: BLUE. Ocean-cooled compute.’ It is warm. It is humming to nobody. A sticker on the hatch reads ‘PILOT DISCONTINUED: see Hollow Creek.’', 'Far to the north-west, alone.', { angler: "A data centre. At the bottom of the sea. Somewhere, a man got a bonus for this.", isopod: "Warm. Staying.", dumbo: "It's a computer taking a bath! They forgot it! Aw, it's still trying!" }],
      hat: ['The hard hat', 'A yellow hard hat lies at the foot of the south-east leg, crown down, home to one extremely territorial shrimp. Across the front, in block capitals: SAFETY FIRST.', 'At the foot of a platform leg.', { angler: "'Safety first.' It's two kilometres from its head. I'd call that third, at best.", isopod: "Good hat.", dumbo: "The shrimp LOVES it! Look how much he hates us! That's love of a hat!" }],
      pigs: ['The sea pigs', 'A herd of sea pigs, pink and see-through, trundling across the silt on tube feet with the calm of animals who have never once been told they are ridiculous.', 'South of the Garden.', { angler: "No stage presence whatsoever. I adore them.", isopod: "Cousins. Sort of.", dumbo: "LOOK AT THEM GO! They're not going anywhere! LOOK AT THEM!" }],
      ducky: ['The rubber duck', 'A yellow rubber duck sits upright on the seabed, faded to cream, smiling at the dark. In 1992 a container of 28,000 of them went overboard in the Pacific. This one took the scenic route.', 'West of the manifold.', { angler: "Finally. Someone down here with a painted-on smile and no lines. A professional.", isopod: "Not food. Checked.", dumbo: "He's SO far from a bath! And he's still smiling! He gets it!" }],
      brine: ['The boot in the brine', 'At the bottom of the brine pool, perfectly pickled, stands a single steel-toed work boot. It has been here for decades and looks like it was dropped this morning. Nothing rots in the brine. Nothing lives in it, either.', 'In the brine pool. Only a thick shell should go in.', { isopod: "Left boot.", angler: "Preserved forever, unchanged, at the bottom of a pool. I know actresses who'd kill for it.", dumbo: "Tank went IN! Tank's so brave! Tank, was it awful? He says it was fine! He always says that!" }]
    },
    NEWS: { solved: 'worked out which well it is', follow: 'caught Scout-7’s eye', seen: 'got the leak on camera', shut: 'shut in the well' },
    cards: { intro: [['Pressure', 'Two thousand one hundred metres down there is no weather, no morning, and no reason for anything to be here.<br><br>Then somebody built Platform Nine, and things moved in.', '', 'Field Notes · Two'], ['', 'They call it the Garden. This week it started going white.<br><br>Three locals have agreed to look into it. One of them brought her own lighting.', '']],
      outro: [['Pressure', 'The footage reached the regulator’s portal with the filename <i>something_shut_it_in_FINAL.mp4</i>. Nobody has been able to rename it.', '', 'Field Notes · Two'], ['', 'A cap crew arrived nine days later. When the platform is retired, the legs stay: a reef, on purpose this time.<br><br>The Chorus has described this as fine.', ''], ['', 'Next: eighteen baskets, one herd, and a line of orange ribbon that lies.', 'end']] },
